message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PeatGuard NISAR: L-band InSAR coherence and relative displacement over drained tropical peat, fused with fire history to rank canal-blocking dam sites"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Quak
    given-names: Tommy
    email: 7ommyquak@gmail.com
    affiliation: "PeatGuard; National University of Singapore"
keywords:
  - NISAR
  - InSAR
  - L-band
  - tropical peatland
  - subsidence
  - Central Kalimantan
  - canal blocking
  - NASA Space Apps Challenge
abstract: >-
  Open-source pipeline and interactive viewer that ingests NASA/ISRO NISAR L2
  GUNW provisional interferograms over the Sebangau and former Mega Rice
  Project peatlands in Central Kalimantan, exports 12-day coherence and 60-day
  relative line-of-sight displacement layers, and fuses them with the Tay et
  al. (2025) ALOS-2 subsidence benchmark, NASA FIRMS fire detections and
  Landsat burn history to rank canal-blocking dam sites for village crews.
